From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: saiththerobo <the.tom.sharp@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 16:56:20 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: exynos: google: gs101-raven: add the CS40L25A
 haptics

Raven's haptic driver sits on hsi2c_8 at 0x43 with its reset on gpp24-0
(active low) and stock's boost limits (4.5 A, 7.5 V), as Google's
gs101-raviole-audio.dtsi describes it; its interrupt (gpa6-5) isn't used
yet. Tested on raven (as an overlay): cs40l25-vibra probes at boot and
feedbackd drives it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Signed-off-by: saiththerobo <the.tom.sharp@gmail.com>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/google/gs101-raven.dts | 15 +++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 15 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/google/gs101-raven.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/google/gs101-raven.dts
index d48e0ae97..266456f9a 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/google/gs101-raven.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/google/gs101-raven.dts
@@ -327,3 +327,18 @@ led {
 		};
 	};
 };
+
+/*
+ * Haptics: a Cirrus Logic CS40L25A at 0x43 (Google's gs101-raviole-audio.dtsi),
+ * reset on gpp24-0, active low. Its interrupt (gpa6-5) isn't used yet.
+ */
+&hsi2c_8 {
+	haptics@43 {
+		compatible = "cirrus,cs40l25a";
+		reg = <0x43>;
+		reset-gpios = <&gpp24 0 GPIO_ACTIVE_LOW>;
+		/* stock's boost: 4.5 A peak, 7.5 V (CLAB) */
+		cirrus,boost-peak-microamp = <4500000>;
+		cirrus,boost-ctl-microvolt = <7500000>;
+	};
+};
